332	/**
333	 * How long an `EmailLog` row is kept. There was no retention at all: every
334	 * message ever sent was kept forever, which is what turned a rendering-preview
335	 * convenience into an indefinite archive of customer correspondence. 90 days is
336	 * long enough to debug a deliverability complaint and short enough that the log
337	 * is not a second copy of the customer database.
